  CallerID: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09cdebfe05ccaad41adda79be1ca9067, type: 2}
  Stages:
  - Text: That's your first contract done! Kevin seems happy with the product, but more importantly, you've now got some cold hard cash.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: You're off to a solid start, but we need to start expanding operations ASAP. Tomorrow we'll set up a new plant in the RV, so let's grab an OG Kush seed now.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: For that, you'll have to pay a visit to <h1>the warehouse</h>. It's the local hub of anything less-than-legal. It's only open from 6PM to 6AM, so head on over then.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  onCallCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
